 know  that where he gets picked  means here's how much money you're going  to make you make your money on the  contracts beyond the first one  so i i don't really view that as that  much of a threat right now the only way  i would view it as a threat is if he  played football and stunk  and and you know then he might get  tempted after three years like if he was  jameis winston right now maybe he'd be  tempted to go and be i mean jameis  winston was the closer at florida state  i wonder if he's thought at all if he  has a bad year with bruce arians this  year  will he go back and try baseball we'll  see  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

